==Battleground==
*5 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chief Peng]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
**1 [[Lione Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
An easy stage that any unit can beat. Use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

